OL,3,GNEWSAMan in his 20s dies after
OL,4,Afour-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has died following a
OL,7,Ffour-vehicle crash in Newry.
OL,9,FThe crash, involving a lorry, van and
OL,10,Ftwo cars, happened on Monday morning at
OL,11,Fthe junction between the Armagh Road
OL,12,Fand Church Road.
OL,14,FTwo other people were taken to hospital
OL,15,Fwith serious injuries.
OL,17,FThe Armagh Road remains closed
OL,18,Ffollowing the crash.
